.TH "nvme_init_fabric_zoning_lookup" 9 "nvme_init_fabric_zoning_lookup" "October 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
nvme_init_fabric_zoning_lookup \- Initialize passthru command for Fabric Zoning Lookup
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "void" nvme_init_fabric_zoning_lookup
.BI "(struct libnvme_passthru_cmd *cmd "  ","
.BI "void *data "  ","
.BI "__u32 len "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "cmd" 12
Passthru command to use
.IP "data" 12
Fabric Zoning Lookup data buffer
.IP "len" 12
Length of \fIdata\fP
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Initializes the passthru command buffer for the Fabric Zoning Lookup
command. The returned Zoning Data Key is available in the completion
result, see \fIenum nvme_fabric_zoning_recv_cqe_dw0\fP for related fields.
